# ZenRay Assets V2, front-end performance audit (7 October 2026)

Repo HEAD d910105e (main). Strictly read-only: state files copied into
`scratch-frontend/`, no bridge call, no service restart. Every timing below is a node 26 run
on this Mac (M5 Max) over the real copied state; browser numbers are ESTIMATED to be of the same
order (V8 in both cases). Scripts used: `scratch-frontend/snapshot-size.mjs`,
`scratch-frontend/pipeline-timing.mjs`, plus the inline `node -e` commands quoted per finding.
Baseline: `npx vitest run src/components/assets/` = 4 files, 29 tests green (7 October 2026).

